{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:b175d6e86a14b03a","name":"Sirona Okeefe","source":{"id":"source:reference-b175d6e86a14b03a","title":"Sirona Okeefe","revision":21743,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T02:23:45Z","sha256":"db87159a689922b6ef7b77e70e2b164959e507053262c4a0e7b5cda42e74df13","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21743","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Sirona%20Okeefe&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-b175d6e86a14b03a","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dawn of Defiance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dawn_of_Defiance"}," (",{"tag":"a","children":["The Traitor's Gambit"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Traitor%27s_Gambit","referenceId":"reference:b765bce19fabefc4"},")"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["House Organa"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/House_Organa","referenceId":"reference:7b8325e7616f3732"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["If the heroes agree to discover the fate of Admiral ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gilder Varth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gilder_Varth","referenceId":"reference:485a4537ae2a1f1a"},", Senator Organa tells them that he has arranged transport aboard a vessel owned and operated by one of his longtime friends. Sirona Okeefe is a free trader and transport pilot who frequently works for Organa and his agents- most recently, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Maya"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Maya","referenceId":"reference:031e45c699d1aace"},". On retainer from the Senator, Captain Okeefe is a beautiful middle-aged woman who knows her way around the galaxy. For the first arc of the ",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Dawn of Defiance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dawn_of_Defiance"}]}," campaign, her modified ",{"tag":"a","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Baudo"]},"-Class Star Yacht"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Baudo-Class_Star_Yacht","referenceId":"reference:c857661df0f1aeac"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["The ",{"tag":"i","children":["Banshee"]}],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Banshee","referenceId":"reference:e93a585137c83f94"},", will serve as the heroes' primary mode of transportation. Captain Okeefe is fiercely loyal to Senator Organa and trusts the heroes only because he does.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The captain is something of a black sheep in her family (which hails from ",{"tag":"a","children":["Brentaal"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Brentaal?action=edit&redlink=1"},") and doesn't care to speak about her past. She does mention that she has a niece who aspires to follow in her footsteps. Otherwise, Okeefe always keeps the conversation light and flirty. Captain Okeefe is also very fond of her Droid copilot, ",{"tag":"a","children":["RX-13"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/RX-13","referenceId":"reference:98e024b7b6e6ff1b"}," nicknamed \"Crash,\" who is curmudgeonly and prefers to gripe about nearly everything rather than go about his duties. Still, the two make a good pair- ",{"tag":"a","children":["The ",{"tag":"i","children":["Banshee"]}],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Banshee","referenceId":"reference:e93a585137c83f94"}," runs smoothly and has a number of special modifications that make it more than a match for Imperial patrols.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Sirona Okeefe Statistics (CL 6)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Normal"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["Human"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Human","referenceId":"reference:9ffa865f2bc6e850"}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scoundrel"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scoundrel","referenceId":"reference:316d580fd4c35ecc"}," 6\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Force Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Points"},":"]}," 5\n"]},{"t